<title>USA: IOWA-S MINN FED CATTLE MARKET NOT WELL TESTED-USDA.</title>
<headline>IOWA-S MINN FED CATTLE MARKET NOT WELL TESTED-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Live basis Compared Wednesday's close, steers and heifers were not tested, USDA said. Carcass basis Steers and heifers not well tested. Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1225-1300 lbs few 106.00 Reported sales for Thurs - 100 Week to Date - 17,000</p>
